      en: ["Murambi is located in Nyamagabe District in the Southern Province.", "It was originally a technical school under construction in 1994.", "An estimated 45,000 to 50,000 people were murdered at this site.", "The site is famous for the lime-preserved remains of genocide victims.", "Murambi was designated a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2023.", "The memorial site includes a library and mass grave burial areas."],
